  "slug": "baked-cod-with-tomatoes-and-oregano",
  "title": "Baked Cod with Tomatoes and Oregano",
  "blurb": "Tender white fish baked with tomatoes, garlic and oregano in a simple Mediterranean-style casserole.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180°C.",
    "Warm half the olive oil in a frying pan over medium heat and cook the onion for 8 minutes until soft.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute, then remove from the heat.",
    "Chop the tomatoes into rough chunks and mix them in a baking dish with the onion mixture, oregano, salt and pepper.",
    "Nestle the cod fillets into the tomato mixture and drizzle with the remaining olive oil.",
    "Cover the dish with foil and bake for 40 minutes, then remove the foil and bake for another 10 minutes until the fish flakes easily."
